<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-ROKISHKIS EXPECTS HIGHER 1997 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-ROKISHKIS EXPECTS HIGHER 1997 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian blue-chip Rokishkis Cheese said on Thursday that it expected a five million litas net profit in the first quarter of the year and a 18 million litas to 20 million litas profit in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Our company is among the biggest of its kind in the Baltic countries,&quot; Pranas Zajanchauskas, technical director, told a news conference which presented the stocl exchange's new official list.</p>
</text>
